  "abstract": "Fourier forecaster with LayerNorm and residual copy, using SAP gates over projection columns with a slightly stronger L1 (\u03bb=1.2e-5) and mild entropy (8e-6). Pmax=40 to focus capacity near the observed sweet spot (p\u224836). Optimizer: Adam lr=9e-4, global clip=1.0. Loss: MAE + temporal curvature.",
